<title>PORTUGAL: Share allocation in EDP sale.</title>
<headline>Share allocation in EDP sale.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the share allocation in the partial privatisation of state utility EDP-Electricidade de Portugal.</p>
<p>EMPLOYEES</p>
<p>1st phase pre-registration - 0.4889 percent</p>
<p>2nd phase pre-registration - 0.326 percent</p>
<p>Period public offer for sale (OPV) - 0.16 percent</p>
<p>SMALL INVESTORS AND EMIGRANTS</p>
<p>1st phase pre-registration - 3.76 percent</p>
<p>2nd phase pre-registration - 2.5 percent</p>
<p>Period OPV - 1.256 percent</p>
<p>BONDHOLDERS</p>
<p>1st phase pre-registration - 1.67 percent</p>
<p>2nd phase pre-registration - 1.11 percent</p>
<p>Period OPV - 0.55 percent</p>
<p>GENERAL PUBLIC</p>
<p>1st phase pre-registration - 1.91 percent</p>
<p>Second phase pre-registration - 1.27 percent</p>
<p>Period OPV - 0.64 percent</p>
<p>(Source: Lisbon bourse)</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
